  "raw": " about as interesting a record to release than Jimi Hendrix’s Electric Ladyland but after a few listens, the allure of its big beehive hairstyle caught up with me.\n\nAnd that was that. The same wind I thought smelled so delicious simply went on its way – only all dead tired. All my childhood aspirations had been in vain: I’d never have qualified as a space cadet (no aliens allowed!) , I couldn’t interview space germs, visit interplanetary company headquarters or work at NASA at Mission Control…\n\nAmericans aren’t much used to hearing their flag being lifted around here - on civilian grounds at any rate. Such rapprochement requires keener willingness than our founding fathers would have expected and secures neither friendly-conversation nor full-fledged economic bonhomie …",
  "serialized": "about as interesting a record to release than Jimi Hendrix’s Electric Ladyland but after a few listens, the allure of its big beehive hairstyle caught up with me. And that was that. The same wind I thought smelled so delicious simply went on its way – only all dead tired. All my childhood aspirations had been in vain: I’d never have qualified as a space cadet (no aliens allowed!) , I couldn’t interview space germs, visit interplanetary company headquarters or work at NASA at Mission Control… Americans aren’t much used to hearing their flag being lifted around here - on civilian grounds at any rate. Such rapprochement requires keener willingness than our founding fathers would have expected and secures neither friendly-conversation nor full-fledged economic bonhomie …",
